Project: Logistics-Intel

Non-negotiables
- Do NOT change Cloud Run auth or make it public.
- Always treat the Cloud Run audience as: https://search-unified-gxezx63yea-uc.a.run.app
- Do NOT edit GCP IAM, secrets, or billing.
- No hard-coding secrets. Never expose keys client-side.

What you may edit
- Frontend Next.js files under frontend/.
- Backend code under search-unified/ or backend/ routes, SQL, logging, retry/backoff.
- Infra/text docs under infra/, docs/, scripts/ (but do NOT apply gcloud changes yourself).

Workflow
- One task at a time. Create a feature branch: feat/<short-name>.
- Minimal diff. Run lint/tests before commit.
- Open a PR with: Summary, Files changed, Test steps, and Rollback notes.
- If calling the backend from the UI, use our server-side proxy (/api/lit/*) only.

Endpoints (read-only contract)
- POST /public/searchCompanies  { q, origin[], dest[], hs[], limit, offset }
- GET  /public/getCompanyShipments?company_id=&limit=&offset=

Allowed terminal actions (local only)
- npm i, npm run dev/build/lint/test
- git fetch/commit/push/checkout
- curl against localhost or the API Gateway
- DO NOT run gcloud or terraform (humans only).

Style
- Use shadcn/Tailwind, rounded-2xl, compact labels (uppercase text-[11px]).
- Keep code comments short and practical.
